          ],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_5_image_14.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.257,
            0.719,
            0.882,
            0.797
          ],
          "content": "Now, we are ready to connect the cell to the lamp to make it glow. We will conduct this activity in two parts — prediction and observation. Some of the ways in which the lamp and the cell can be connected are shown in Table 3.1."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.296,
            0.801,
            0.883,
            0.839
          ],
          "content": "**Predict**, for each arrangement, if the lamp will glow or not and write your prediction in Table 3.1."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.296,
            0.843,
            0.884,
            0.918
          ],
          "content": "Now, connect the lamp and the cell, and observe if the lamp glows or not. Note down your observation in Table 3.1. Also, for the lamps which glow, colour their glass bulbs yellow."
        },
